WEBVTT

00:00:40.590 --> 00:00:41.490
Kiyoshi Otsuka
I'm the plant manager at a factory in Sorasaki.

00:00:43.090 --> 00:00:43.870
Scan Complete

00:00:51.450 --> 00:00:53.000
Kiyoshi Otsuka

00:01:00.700 --> 00:01:04.410
There are 20 puppet guards and 10 human ones.

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:07.540
Once you gain access, the alarm will sound immediately.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:09.290
Chiyome here, along with...

00:01:09.540 --> 00:01:11.290
...Fuma. Roger that.

00:01:11.290 --> 00:01:14.080
Goemon here. I've arrived at the  standby position.

00:01:24.080 --> 00:01:27.160
Hanzo here. Target confirmed.

00:01:27.580 --> 00:01:31.540
Get out of there as soon as you
acquire the data we're after.

00:01:31.870 --> 00:01:34.200
Tsukikage, start the mission!

00:01:40.440 --> 00:01:43.910
PERSEVERANCE

00:01:40.660 --> 00:01:42.450
"Unauthorized access"?!

00:01:42.450 --> 00:01:44.500
Our countermeasures won't stop it in time!

00:01:43.910 --> 00:01:45.790
You've been hacked.

00:01:45.660 --> 00:01:47.700
Gah, I can't get through!

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:50.750
I'll head over there right now, Honey.

00:01:50.750 --> 00:01:53.160
I'm counting on you, my knight.

00:01:57.410 --> 00:01:59.250
Looks like it's locked, after all.

00:01:59.250 --> 00:02:01.080
I can't unlock it remotely.

00:02:01.370 --> 00:02:05.040
Hmph! I'll just force my way in as originally planned.

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:16.410
I took the opportunity to deactivate the alarm.

00:02:16.410 --> 00:02:17.450
Good work, everyone.

00:02:17.450 --> 00:02:19.750
I might be a bit sore tomorrow.

00:02:20.370 --> 00:02:23.830
We'll meet up in three minutes.
The car's the rendezvous point.

00:02:23.830 --> 00:02:26.000
Tsubone here. Copy that.

00:02:29.790 --> 00:02:32.040
Seems this factory really is up to no good.

00:02:32.870 --> 00:02:33.750
Let's do this.

00:02:40.870 --> 00:02:45.290
Consuming Spyce increases chemical activity
in the brain and elevates physical ability.

00:02:45.830 --> 00:02:47.330
Limiter removal!

00:03:01.660 --> 00:03:03.830
Talk about flawless teamwork...

00:03:03.830 --> 00:03:05.450
We finished 'em off with style, huh?

00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:11.410
If you take it out with your rifle,
there's nothing for us to do down here!

00:03:11.410 --> 00:03:12.450
Ah...

00:03:12.450 --> 00:03:14.450
There's a figure approaching fast!

00:03:15.040 --> 00:03:16.620
I'll handle them.

00:03:16.620 --> 00:03:18.450
I'll back you up, Yuki-chan.

00:03:18.700 --> 00:03:20.120
Call me "Hanzo."

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:25.870
We've taken control of them. They're friendlies now.

00:03:25.870 --> 00:03:26.790
Good grief.

00:03:27.500 --> 00:03:30.330
I knew I had a bad feeling about tonight...

00:03:30.790 --> 00:03:32.660
Don't dance with death!

00:03:33.910 --> 00:03:36.660
There's nobody who's a match for me.

00:03:38.200 --> 00:03:39.540
Guess there is...

00:03:44.000 --> 00:03:47.580
Wow, it's so pretty every time we come here.

00:03:47.870 --> 00:03:48.540
Hm...?

00:03:51.120 --> 00:03:54.700
Mom, are there some people
flying through the air over there...?

00:03:54.700 --> 00:03:57.450
Huh? I can't see anything.

00:03:57.450 --> 00:04:00.000
What could it be? Certainly suspicious...

00:04:00.790 --> 00:04:03.410
I'm getting a whiff that there's an incident afoot.

00:04:03.410 --> 00:04:05.410
Oh my, you sound just like your father.

00:04:05.700 --> 00:04:06.750
Really?!

00:04:12.750 --> 00:04:16.290
Mission accomplished! I'm super hungry!

00:04:16.620 --> 00:04:18.200
What do you want to eat?

00:04:39.950 --> 00:04:42.660
I'm heading out now, Dad.

00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:47.250
Aww, the scent of spring...

00:04:48.200 --> 00:04:50.790
So, I kicked his ass real good.

00:04:51.040 --> 00:04:52.450
For real?!

00:04:52.450 --> 00:04:54.500
Ah, this's dangerous.

00:04:52.870 --> 00:04:55.290
I showed that guy who's boss.

00:04:55.290 --> 00:04:56.040
Alright then...

00:04:55.290 --> 00:04:57.580
Senpai, you don't mess around!

00:04:58.700 --> 00:05:00.000
That's good stuff!

00:05:01.750 --> 00:05:03.500
Smoking's not allowed here.

00:05:03.500 --> 00:05:05.040
Oh, sorry.

00:05:05.040 --> 00:05:07.330
And make sure you clean up those cigarette butts.

00:05:07.330 --> 00:05:08.450
Yes, ma'am!

00:05:09.410 --> 00:05:10.910
G-good morning.

00:05:10.910 --> 00:05:12.080
Really sorry 'bout that.

00:05:12.080 --> 00:05:13.790
Momo-chan, good morning!

00:05:13.790 --> 00:05:16.000
So, how's the new school year going?

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:19.790
My friends and I all ended up in different classes...

00:05:20.580 --> 00:05:23.410
My goal is to make some new friends!

00:05:23.790 --> 00:05:25.540
Shouldn't take long for a girl like you, Momo-chan.

00:05:25.540 --> 00:05:26.870
Thanks.

00:05:26.870 --> 00:05:28.580
I'll be on my way now, Auntie.

00:05:28.580 --> 00:05:29.910
Take care!

00:05:30.450 --> 00:05:32.290
New friends...

00:05:32.620 --> 00:05:34.410
New friends...!

00:05:38.930 --> 00:05:41.930
First period break time

00:05:41.930 --> 00:05:44.930
Second period break time

00:05:44.930 --> 00:05:47.930
Third period break time

00:05:47.930 --> 00:05:50.580
Fourth period break time

00:05:51.200 --> 00:05:53.500
There's no way I can do it...

00:05:54.870 --> 00:05:55.620
Yes?!

00:05:55.950 --> 00:05:56.870
Hey.

00:05:56.870 --> 00:06:00.200
Ah, Yua. You came to see me?

00:06:00.200 --> 00:06:03.330
Yeah, I've already made some friends in my class, so...

00:06:03.500 --> 00:06:05.450
Ah! I'm happy for you.

00:06:06.080 --> 00:06:10.000
Post-graduation
Plans Questionnaire

00:06:06.910 --> 00:06:09.910
So... aren't you gonna write down "police officer"?

00:06:10.580 --> 00:06:14.910
Well, the thing is... I guess you could say
I don't have any confidence.

00:06:14.910 --> 00:06:17.290
I know you can do it, Momochi.

00:06:17.290 --> 00:06:19.700
You've got a crazy good nose and eyesight, after all.

00:06:19.700 --> 00:06:21.200
Oh, that, huh?

00:06:21.200 --> 00:06:23.750
I mean, you even said
you spotted something again last night.

00:06:24.000 --> 00:06:27.250
Yeah, I did! When I went to see
the view of the factory at night,

00:06:27.250 --> 00:06:29.660
I noticed some suspicious
figures moving through the sky!

00:06:29.660 --> 00:06:30.910
Whatcha talkin' about?

00:06:30.910 --> 00:06:32.500
I really mean it.

00:06:35.040 --> 00:06:36.910
Thanks for stopping by.

00:06:37.580 --> 00:06:39.120
Hey, Minamoto-san.

00:06:40.080 --> 00:06:42.290
Yachiyo-san, Ishikawa-san!

00:06:42.290 --> 00:06:44.790
We happened to overhear a bit of your conversation.

00:06:44.790 --> 00:06:46.040
Uh-huh, uh-huh.

00:06:46.040 --> 00:06:47.830
Can we be friends?

00:06:47.830 --> 00:06:49.330
Uh-huh, uh-huh.

00:06:50.120 --> 00:06:51.540
Of course!

00:06:51.540 --> 00:06:52.500
I'm glad to hear that.

00:06:52.500 --> 00:06:53.250
Yeah.

00:06:55.290 --> 00:06:58.950
If you come by the place where I work part-time,
you can get a discount...

00:06:59.200 --> 00:07:02.000
Oh, I didn't know you have a part-time job, Ishikawa-san.

00:07:08.450 --> 00:07:09.620
Hello.

00:07:09.620 --> 00:07:10.500
Hello.

00:07:10.500 --> 00:07:11.700
Good day to you.

00:07:11.700 --> 00:07:13.910
H-hello there.

00:07:14.750 --> 00:07:16.080
Hello.

00:07:21.620 --> 00:07:24.200
Snap out of it! She already left.

00:07:26.120 --> 00:07:28.290
You really look up to her, don't you?

00:07:28.830 --> 00:07:29.620
You can tell...?

00:07:30.950 --> 00:07:33.080
Yuki Hanzomon-senpai!

00:07:33.080 --> 00:07:37.870
Besides being the heir to a dojo,
she's strong, pretty, stylish, smart...

00:07:37.870 --> 00:07:40.750
I've admired her ever since
the school entrance ceremony!

00:07:40.870 --> 00:07:42.160
Oh, I see.

00:07:42.330 --> 00:07:45.040
I want to be like her...

00:07:45.040 --> 00:07:48.580
Hatsume Aoba-senpai, who was there with her,
is also pretty amazing!

00:07:48.870 --> 00:07:51.540
She's been friends with Yuki-senpai
since they were little, right?

00:07:51.540 --> 00:07:52.700
You sure know a lot.

00:07:52.700 --> 00:07:55.790
I briefly looked into some of our seniors at school...

00:07:56.290 --> 00:07:58.000
D-does that offend you?!

00:07:58.200 --> 00:08:01.200
So you look into things
you're curious about - that's good!

00:08:01.500 --> 00:08:03.040
Glad you feel that way...

00:08:05.290 --> 00:08:06.080
This's the place.

00:08:06.620 --> 00:08:08.500
They're known for their curry.

00:08:08.500 --> 00:08:09.910
"Wasabi"?

00:08:09.910 --> 00:08:12.500
Never knew about this place even though it's so close.

00:08:13.450 --> 00:08:14.910
We're heading in, bud.

00:08:14.960 --> 00:08:16.100
Open

00:08:16.000 --> 00:08:17.540
Ah! Yo!

00:08:20.080 --> 00:08:20.950
Hello there.

00:08:21.120 --> 00:08:22.830
H-hello.

00:08:25.160 --> 00:08:27.750
That girl's a first-year, right?

00:08:27.950 --> 00:08:28.910
That's right.

00:08:35.700 --> 00:08:38.120
Goe-chan, welcome!

00:08:38.910 --> 00:08:40.950
I'll have the bacon curry, please.

00:08:40.950 --> 00:08:42.870
Dry curry for me.

00:08:43.080 --> 00:08:47.080
I'll have... the hamburger curry, please.

00:08:47.080 --> 00:08:48.500
Alright, got it.

00:08:49.250 --> 00:08:52.290
Always by your side, forever...

00:08:51.790 --> 00:08:53.080
Science is Power

00:08:52.790 --> 00:08:55.330
Science is power. Kyuten.

00:08:53.870 --> 00:08:55.250
Kyuten Science

00:08:57.290 --> 00:08:59.870
Hey, that thing's real, right?

00:09:00.540 --> 00:09:03.700
He's this place's mascot. Cute, huh?

00:09:04.620 --> 00:09:08.370
Also, there's another under the TV
and one next to the cash register.

00:09:08.830 --> 00:09:10.330
Whoa...

00:09:10.830 --> 00:09:12.160
Mmm...

00:09:12.370 --> 00:09:15.160
I'm picking up the pleasant scent of cumin and clover.

00:09:15.160 --> 00:09:18.790
Oh, you can tell what spices they are?

00:09:18.790 --> 00:09:19.660
Yes.

00:09:19.830 --> 00:09:21.290
You've got quite a nose.

00:09:22.750 --> 00:09:25.450
Wow, thanks for the meal.

00:09:29.410 --> 00:09:31.080
It's delicious!

00:09:31.330 --> 00:09:33.580
I love spicy food.

00:09:34.120 --> 00:09:36.950
Minamoto-san, you look so happy eating.

00:09:36.950 --> 00:09:39.290
Using "-san" seems a bit too formal.

00:09:39.290 --> 00:09:41.000
I think it's time to reintroduce ourselves.

00:09:41.500 --> 00:09:44.580
I'm Mei Yachiyo. Just "Mei" is fine.

00:09:45.410 --> 00:09:46.790
I'm Goe Ishikawa.

00:09:47.000 --> 00:09:48.410
You can call her "Goe-chan."

00:09:48.910 --> 00:09:49.660
That's fine.

00:09:50.000 --> 00:09:51.910
I'm Momo Minamoto.

00:09:51.910 --> 00:09:54.950
My nickname is... "Momochi."

00:09:55.160 --> 00:09:57.330
Alright, we'll call you that too, then.

00:09:57.330 --> 00:09:58.410
Uh-huh. Uh-huh.

00:09:59.450 --> 00:10:02.580
To celebrate you becoming friends,
I'll treat you to a drink.

00:10:02.580 --> 00:10:03.870
I'll take a squash.

00:10:03.870 --> 00:10:06.000
And with lime, not lemon.

00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:08.000
Y-you're pretty particular, huh?

00:10:09.620 --> 00:10:13.540
Wow, you sing and play music
in front of the train station, Mei-chan?

00:10:13.540 --> 00:10:14.790
She's really good.

00:10:15.040 --> 00:10:16.700
I'll come and listen to you sometime!

00:10:16.700 --> 00:10:18.540
Oh, really?!

00:10:18.750 --> 00:10:20.750
That's just wonderful!

00:10:20.750 --> 00:10:22.000
My dear friend!

00:10:22.870 --> 00:10:23.950
Happy to do it.

00:10:26.040 --> 00:10:27.080
Wha...?!

00:10:27.080 --> 00:10:29.290
Mei-chan, are you not getting enough sleep?

00:10:29.290 --> 00:10:31.620
Huh?! Well, that is true...

00:10:31.620 --> 00:10:33.790
It just seemed like you're feeling a little off.

00:10:33.790 --> 00:10:35.330
How'd you figure that out?

00:10:35.330 --> 00:10:40.910
My tongue's really sensitive. When I lick someone,
I'm able to tell how they're doing physically.

00:10:40.910 --> 00:10:43.580
Amazing! Try it out on Goe-chan, too!

00:10:43.750 --> 00:10:44.700
Go ahead.

00:10:44.700 --> 00:10:46.500
Well, if you don't mind...

00:10:48.750 --> 00:10:50.580
You've got some muscle soreness.

00:10:50.750 --> 00:10:51.910
You're right.

00:10:53.660 --> 00:10:56.580
Hmm, so that's what muscle soreness tastes like...

00:10:56.580 --> 00:10:58.290
Yeah, I still don't get it.

00:10:58.290 --> 00:11:00.950
Normally, I'd think it wouldn't taste like anything...

00:11:01.290 --> 00:11:03.080
You've got a talented tongue.

00:11:03.330 --> 00:11:05.200
I've got a good nose and eyes, too.

00:11:05.200 --> 00:11:09.580
Actually, just yesterday when I went to see
some night scenery, I spotted some figures up in the sky.

00:11:09.580 --> 00:11:11.870
Oh, really? What were they like?

00:11:12.200 --> 00:11:15.080
They were just silhouettes I couldn't make out clearly...

00:11:15.410 --> 00:11:16.620
But just maybe...!

00:11:20.290 --> 00:11:22.330
Flying humanoids...?

00:11:23.830 --> 00:11:26.950
They really exist, okay? I saw it on TV.

00:11:27.830 --> 00:11:30.000
I'm glad we became friends!

00:11:30.620 --> 00:11:31.950
Same here!

00:11:32.160 --> 00:11:36.000
Before long, I suppose I'll show you my hidden side.

00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:37.080
So you've got one...

00:11:37.080 --> 00:11:38.410
I am a girl, after all.

00:11:38.790 --> 00:11:40.870
I've got a secret or two.

00:11:42.580 --> 00:11:44.620
Hello, Momo-chan.

00:11:44.540 --> 00:11:46.500
Drugstore
Ramen
Sorasaki

00:11:44.910 --> 00:11:46.330
Hello.

00:11:46.500 --> 00:11:55.700
Stand-up Drinking Bar

00:11:47.080 --> 00:11:50.000
Oh, Momo, you've grown again.

00:11:50.000 --> 00:11:52.580
Hi! I'm getting taller day by day.

00:11:52.580 --> 00:11:54.950
Well, seems like something
good happened to you today.

00:11:54.950 --> 00:11:55.700
Yes!

00:11:55.680 --> 00:12:03.200
Japanese
Beef

00:11:55.870 --> 00:11:58.410
Momo-chan, have you been eating your meat?

00:11:58.830 --> 00:12:01.080
I sure have been!

00:12:01.080 --> 00:12:02.750
Damn you! Thief!

00:12:03.450 --> 00:12:05.410
Somebody stop him!

00:12:05.950 --> 00:12:06.870
Outta my way!

00:12:16.700 --> 00:12:19.040
I'm glad I ran into you.

00:12:19.040 --> 00:12:20.450
You must've been pretty startled.

00:12:20.450 --> 00:12:23.700
Ayumu-san smells great, as usual...

00:12:23.950 --> 00:12:27.290
Lately, there's been an increase of weirdos around town.

00:12:27.290 --> 00:12:28.660
Is that so?

00:12:28.830 --> 00:12:33.250
Well, more importantly... how about you?
Make any new friends?

00:12:33.540 --> 00:12:34.870
I did!

00:12:35.120 --> 00:12:37.620
But I've also got a new problem now...

00:12:38.200 --> 00:12:39.330
Post-graduation
Plans Questionnaire

00:12:39.330 --> 00:12:42.870
Whether I'll be able to follow in my father's footsteps...

00:12:42.870 --> 00:12:46.370
But, I froze up when I saw that bag-snatcher.

00:12:46.370 --> 00:12:48.700
So I wonder if I can really handle stuff like that...

00:12:48.700 --> 00:12:54.620
Hmm... As someone who owes so much to your father,
I also find that to be an important question.

00:12:55.040 --> 00:12:58.330
Alright, then! I'll talk it over with you
when I go on my break.

00:12:59.500 --> 00:13:01.370
Thank you, Ayumu-san!

00:13:01.370 --> 00:13:05.660
I'll contact you. My break is coming up
after I patrol Ogimachi.

00:13:05.870 --> 00:13:06.500
Okay!

00:13:08.160 --> 00:13:10.790
Well then, time for me to get back to work.

00:13:15.970 --> 00:13:18.970
GOLDEN SPIRITS

00:13:18.970 --> 00:13:21.970
GOLDEN SPIRITS

00:13:21.970 --> 00:13:23.750
Yua
I finished it
Really? I'm not done yet...
Studying!
Come to think of it,
where'd you go after school?

00:13:23.750 --> 00:13:25.750
Oh, right! I went to a curry restaurant
with new friends I made today.
I even got to talk
to Hanzomon-senpai.
Happy!!
What?! Seriously?!
Congrats!
Oh, sorry.
Mom's calling me
to come take a bath.
I'll be in the bath
for a bit.

00:13:26.410 --> 00:13:28.750
Hanzomon-senpai...

00:13:28.750 --> 00:13:31.250
I'm happy... so happy...!

00:13:35.660 --> 00:13:38.290
Ayumu-san sure is taking her time.

00:13:38.620 --> 00:13:40.870
I wonder if something happened...

00:13:42.790 --> 00:13:44.700
I'm going back to work now.

00:13:45.250 --> 00:13:46.500
Take care!

00:13:52.120 --> 00:13:54.250
I'm glad Mom was already asleep.

00:13:54.450 --> 00:13:58.250
Simply having a feeling something's amiss
isn't exactly a reason for me to head out, after all.

00:13:58.500 --> 00:14:01.580
My break is coming up after I patrol Ogimachi.

00:14:01.580 --> 00:14:02.870
Ogimachi!

00:14:06.700 --> 00:14:10.250
Ayumu-san's scent... I'm sure I'm picking it up, but...

00:14:15.790 --> 00:14:16.660
That way!

00:14:21.790 --> 00:14:22.790
What...?

00:14:23.450 --> 00:14:25.910
To think we'd actually be found out by the po-po...

00:14:25.910 --> 00:14:29.410
This is why I hate dealing with you guys.

00:14:29.410 --> 00:14:32.370
Wh-wh-what should I do...?

00:14:32.540 --> 00:14:34.410
R-right... Call the police...

00:14:34.620 --> 00:14:36.830
Let's hurry up and take care of 'em then get outta here.

00:14:38.950 --> 00:14:40.500
Time to get cooking.

00:14:43.700 --> 00:14:44.620
This won't do...

00:14:45.790 --> 00:14:48.660
Now's no time to just freeze up again!

00:14:51.290 --> 00:14:52.870
I've contacted the police!

00:14:52.870 --> 00:14:54.870
I got a clear photo of your faces, you know!

00:14:55.910 --> 00:14:57.370
Another pest, huh?!

00:14:57.370 --> 00:14:58.870
Just leave her to me!

00:14:58.870 --> 00:15:01.290
Aah! I told you, I've contacted the police!

00:15:01.290 --> 00:15:04.750
Pretty quick on your feet, aren't you?!

00:15:04.950 --> 00:15:07.200
Somebody, help me!

00:15:11.750 --> 00:15:15.410
Hmm, seems like the goods are the real deal.

00:15:15.620 --> 00:15:16.290
Ah!

00:15:17.200 --> 00:15:18.950
Bye-bye, photos!

00:15:20.290 --> 00:15:24.000
I'll drown that girl in the sea!

00:15:24.000 --> 00:15:25.700
AAHHH!

00:15:30.790 --> 00:15:31.870
Huh?!

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:36.700
Hanzomon... senpai?!

00:15:37.330 --> 00:15:38.410
Good evening!

00:15:38.790 --> 00:15:41.250
Sorasaki's pretty nice at night, isn't it?

00:15:41.250 --> 00:15:42.120
What the...?!

00:15:42.370 --> 00:15:44.080
Huh? But why?!

00:15:44.250 --> 00:15:48.000
A military-puppet smuggling site... huh?

00:15:48.370 --> 00:15:49.370
Let's do this.

00:15:51.620 --> 00:15:52.540
Mission...

00:15:55.000 --> 00:15:55.660
...start!

00:16:08.000 --> 00:16:09.040
Now!

00:16:11.870 --> 00:16:12.870
Damn it!

00:16:15.290 --> 00:16:16.660
Complete!

00:16:18.950 --> 00:16:20.250
Ayumu-san!

00:16:20.620 --> 00:16:22.080
Are you okay?!

00:16:22.080 --> 00:16:23.250
Yeah, I'm fi-

00:16:23.750 --> 00:16:24.660
Huh?!

00:16:24.660 --> 00:16:27.910
Just seeing to it that they have
no memory of these last few hours.

00:16:27.030 --> 00:16:28.530
Bullet Type
Memory Erasure
Remaining

00:16:28.410 --> 00:16:29.950
The police will be here in a minute.

00:16:31.750 --> 00:16:33.370
Seems there's still more of 'em.

00:16:33.950 --> 00:16:34.700
We're giving chase!

00:16:34.700 --> 00:16:36.080
Wh-what?!

00:16:40.830 --> 00:16:43.080
Whoa, it's totally bulletproof.

00:16:43.080 --> 00:16:48.330
Um... A-are you going to wipe my memory, too?

00:16:51.160 --> 00:16:55.160
First of all, take some time
and calm down. Then we'll talk.

00:16:55.160 --> 00:16:56.200
A-alright.

00:16:56.200 --> 00:16:58.580
You were recommended to us by Mei Yachiyo.

00:16:58.750 --> 00:17:01.160
I haven't composed myself yet!

00:17:04.250 --> 00:17:06.700
What in the world is she so angry about?

00:17:07.040 --> 00:17:09.830
We'll decide whether or not
to wipe your memory after we talk.

00:17:11.000 --> 00:17:18.330
The five of us are students who attend Sorasaki
High School, but we're also keepers of the peace.

00:17:18.330 --> 00:17:19.700
We're called Tsukikage!

00:17:20.080 --> 00:17:24.450
We're a righteous organization who's been
beating back evil since the Warring States period!

00:17:24.450 --> 00:17:30.870
We're fighting against Moryo, a global crime syndicate
that's taken root even in this very city.

00:17:30.870 --> 00:17:33.700
As well as other baddies who are in cahoots with them!

00:17:34.120 --> 00:17:37.410
Which means we engage in spy activities in secret.

00:17:37.410 --> 00:17:41.000
"Secret," you say...? Seems like you
go about it in a pretty flashy way.

00:17:40.110 --> 00:17:43.000
Warning: 
Do Not Cross

00:17:41.000 --> 00:17:43.040
Ooh, it's a big raid...

00:17:43.330 --> 00:17:46.290
Not a problem! We use holograms
for camouflage, you see.

00:17:47.620 --> 00:17:50.790
We've also had our share of interactions
with the police, and they're cooperative.

00:17:55.870 --> 00:17:57.700
They're quite ill-behaved.

00:18:04.250 --> 00:18:05.660
What an awesome car...

00:18:05.910 --> 00:18:07.410
You've got that right!

00:18:07.410 --> 00:18:11.000
It can go 0 to 60 mph in 3 seconds,
and it's even got an emergency evacuation system.

00:18:11.000 --> 00:18:12.250
We did a great job building this thing!

00:18:12.250 --> 00:18:13.410
In front, in front!

00:18:13.410 --> 00:18:16.750
The tear gas this car's equipped
with is another reason it's great.

00:18:16.750 --> 00:18:18.000
Yes, exactly!

00:18:18.250 --> 00:18:19.950
That's not what I meant!

00:18:19.950 --> 00:18:21.540
Stop being so noisy.

00:18:21.540 --> 00:18:23.750
Just like I, who is absolutely flawless, try to-

00:18:28.450 --> 00:18:29.750
S-sorry about that.

00:18:30.290 --> 00:18:34.290
This taste is two-thirds anger and the rest is... jealousy?

00:18:36.540 --> 00:18:40.160
Um... So why exactly are you scouting me?

00:18:40.410 --> 00:18:42.750
You've got a super talented tongue and great nose!

00:18:42.750 --> 00:18:45.500
Didn't you just now figure something
out when you kissed her?

00:18:45.500 --> 00:18:47.750
Oh, I should've known that was why.

00:18:47.750 --> 00:18:50.290
Above all, you did your best to help that policewoman!

00:18:51.330 --> 00:18:53.290
You can come on out, Kamari.

00:18:54.750 --> 00:18:55.660
Wha...?!

00:18:55.660 --> 00:18:58.330
He's a frog who has received ninja training.

00:18:58.660 --> 00:19:02.450
Momochi, those figures you saw at the factory
were me and the girls, you know.

00:19:03.660 --> 00:19:05.950
I hid Kamari in your pocket.

00:19:06.290 --> 00:19:07.540
Sorry 'bout that!

00:19:07.790 --> 00:19:10.870
We've had you under surveillance.

00:19:11.370 --> 00:19:13.330
That's why we were able to come
to your rescue so quickly.

00:19:14.080 --> 00:19:15.540
He's equipped with a mic, you see.

00:19:15.540 --> 00:19:19.000
Huh?! So you heard me talking
to myself in my room, then?!

00:19:21.160 --> 00:19:25.950
Just so happens Hanzo...
Yuki-chan doesn't have an apprentice right now.

00:19:25.950 --> 00:19:28.700
So I thought you might be a fit for the position.

00:19:31.950 --> 00:19:35.160
If you decline, we'll erase your memories
going back to last evening,

00:19:35.160 --> 00:19:36.830
so please decide right now.

00:19:38.120 --> 00:19:40.000
You can do it, Momochi!

00:19:40.000 --> 00:19:41.750
High school girls are invincible!

00:19:43.040 --> 00:19:46.160
I-I...

00:19:47.620 --> 00:19:48.950
I...

00:19:50.000 --> 00:19:51.870
want to protect people, but...

00:19:53.790 --> 00:19:55.370
I don't have any confidence.

00:19:56.580 --> 00:20:02.910
I'm not the heir to a martial arts dojo
or anything like Hanzomon-senpai is...

00:20:03.620 --> 00:20:06.580
So, the idea I could handle being in Tsukikage is...

00:20:06.870 --> 00:20:09.330
Me and my mentor are both just ordinary girls, you know.

00:20:13.040 --> 00:20:14.290
We've got you now!

00:20:16.040 --> 00:20:19.660
It's only natural not to have confidence at first.

00:20:20.700 --> 00:20:26.000
The efforts you make and results you achieve...
lead to confidence.

00:20:29.620 --> 00:20:30.750
Time for the last resort...

00:20:54.700 --> 00:20:57.500
And then a pinch of Spyce.

00:21:12.450 --> 00:21:16.370
"The efforts you make and results you achieve..."

00:21:19.330 --> 00:21:22.910
I haven't... done anything yet.

00:21:23.330 --> 00:21:25.200
What's important is your will.

00:21:25.620 --> 00:21:27.950
If you choose to join us, I'll train you.

00:21:28.700 --> 00:21:31.950
What's this feeling...? Something's welling up inside me...

00:21:32.250 --> 00:21:33.700
It's a surge of emotion.

00:21:35.040 --> 00:21:36.290
"A surge of emotion"...

00:21:44.910 --> 00:21:47.290
I love this city!

00:21:47.830 --> 00:21:49.620
I love this city's people!

00:21:50.000 --> 00:21:52.950
So I want to protect it... That's how I feel!

00:21:53.450 --> 00:21:56.250
Please let me join Tsukikage!

00:23:41.580 --> 00:23:47.330
Incompetents like you lot should at least make
themselves useful as test subjects for a new drug...

00:23:47.500 --> 00:23:48.750
Right, Chitchi?

00:23:49.250 --> 00:23:52.080
The stolen data won't be a problem, will it?

00:23:52.080 --> 00:23:54.620
That alone won't be enough to figure anything out.

00:23:54.790 --> 00:23:56.200
They're so irritating.

00:23:56.200 --> 00:23:57.950
This is Tsukikage's doing, right?

00:23:58.580 --> 00:24:00.450
Apparently, just a short while ago,

00:24:00.450 --> 00:24:06.540
a member of Tsukikage established contact and said
they wish to change sides and join us at Moryo.

00:24:08.410 --> 00:24:11.750
With our new plan we'll surely crush Tsukikage.

00:24:13.200 --> 00:24:15.120
And this city with them...

00:24:15.960 --> 00:24:31.000
Next Episode

00:24:15.960 --> 00:24:31.000
First Challenge

00:24:16.540 --> 00:24:20.410
Original curry, without honey,
and with lots of garam masala!

00:24:20.580 --> 00:24:22.830
Mmm, looks delicious!

00:24:24.250 --> 00:24:25.500
This tastes weird...

00:24:25.500 --> 00:24:28.750
Sir, I'm not feeling well,
so I'm going to head to the nurse's office.

00:24:28.750 --> 00:24:30.450
I'm gonna cry!
